REGIONAL GAZETTE

REGIONAL GAZETTE

NUMBER 2 YEAR 2013

REGIONAL REGULATION OF KUDUS REGENCY

NUMBER 2 YEAR

CONCERNING

ORGANIZATION OF PROTECTION FOR VICTIMS OF GENDER-BASED VIOLENCE AND CHILDREN

BY THE GRACE OF ALMIGHTY GOD THE REGENT OF KUDUS,

Considering : a. that all forms of violence, especially gender-based violence and violence against children, are violations of human rights and crimes against human dignity as well as forms of discrimination;

b. that victims of gender-based violence and violence against children must receive protection, whether from the Regional Government, related agencies, and/or the community in order to avoid and be free from violence and/or threats of violence in the household and community;

c. that based on Law Number 23 Year 2002 concerning

Child Protection and Law

Number 23 Year 2004 concerning

Elimination of Domestic Violence, the Regional Government, related agencies, and/or the community are obligated to undertake efforts to prevent, protect, and restore victims of gender-based violence and violence against children;

d. that based on the considerations as referred to in point a, point b, and point c, it is necessary to establish

a Regional Regulation concerning

Organization of Protection for

Victims of Gender-Based Violence

and Children;

In view of : 1. Article 18 paragraph (6) of the Constitution of the State of the Republic of Indonesia

Year 1945;

2. Law Number 13 Year 1950 concerning the Establishment of Regency

Regions within the Province of

Central Java;

3. Law Number 4 Year 1979 concerning Child Welfare (State

Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia Year 1979

Number 32, Supplement to the State Gazette

